{"id":"5a8141676f191f64","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetic Hierarchy","display":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","aliases":["57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","57-df-kleene-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</span><span>57-df-kleene-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-arithmetic-hierarchy-—-Arithmetic-Hierarchy-$\\Sigma_n^0,-\\Pi_n^0,-\\Delta_n^0$\">df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0, \\Delta_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0, \\Delta_n^0\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{QFree}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\\)</span> 是<strong>原始语法公式集合</strong>，保留量词自由的初层，不是自然数集合的类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，变量块长度允许零；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\vec x\\varphi\">\\(\\exists\\vec x\\varphi\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x\\varphi\">\\(\\forall\\vec x\\varphi\\)</span> 按所列顺序逐个构造量词，空块返回原公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}:\\mathrm{QFree}(\\varphi)\\},\\qquad\\Pi_0^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_0^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_0^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}:\\mathrm{QFree}(\\varphi)\\},\\qquad\\Pi_0^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_0^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_k\\varphi:k\\in\\mathbb N\\land(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\land\\varphi\\in\\Pi_n^0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_k\\varphi:k\\in\\mathbb N\\land(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\land\\varphi\\in\\Pi_n^0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_k\\varphi:k\\in\\mathbb N\\land(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x_1\\cdots\\forall x_k\\varphi:k\\in\\mathbb N\\land(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^0\\cap\\Pi_n^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_n^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n^0\\cap\\Pi_n^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这一定义不按逻辑等价闭包，也不把公式直接视为自然数集合。其非标准但明确的语法分类保留；旧 Remark 中将它直接等同可枚举集类的说法删除。数值关系层级另有自己的文件和载体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy-—-Arithmetic-Hierarchy-$\\Sigma_n^0,-\\Pi_n^0,-\\Delta_n^0$","text":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy $\\Sigma_n^0, \\Pi_n^0, \\Delta_n^0$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-S-ar","status":"resolved","id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","anchor"