","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为扩展 $S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 的有效可数语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$。$\\vdash$ 为 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶关系，$\\mathfrak N$ 为 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构。$\\Sigma_1^0$ 在本文件专指 [[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]] 的语法公式集合。固定变量 $x$；使用 $\\mathrm{Bew}_T$ 时，必须同时给出一个 $B_T\\in\\mathcal B(T,g,x)$，该候选族由下式定义。不同合法选择不被视为字面相同的公式。"},{"id":"6e2653d41c62cb0e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]: 算术层级的定义基础"},{"id":"4a894c201e15cf14","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"536f78c4d1ada7bd","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。本文件 $\\mathrm{Dec}$ 使用 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的理论类，演算固定为标准 Hilbert 演算。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 是数值集合类。$\\Sigma_1^0$ 仅在下式第二行表示 [[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]] 的语法公式集合，$E_1$ 为其标准真句子的码集。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57